4. Added an `ErrorBoundary` component to catch and handle any runtime errors
5. Kept the existing form provider setup

This should resolve the `SchedulingType` export error by providing a mock implementation. The additional error handling and loading states will help catch any other potential issues that might arise.

If you encounter any other specific errors after this change, please let me know and I can help adjust the mocking or add additional required context/providers.

